 "result": "Call order (all under `src/tessel/`):\n\n1. `Tessel.finalize_request` (`app.py:1021`) – called at the end of dispatch (`app.py:1019`) or from the error handler path (`app.py:948`); runs `make_response`, then calls:\n2. `Tessel.finalize_reply` (`app.py:1394`) – runs post-processing, then at `app.py:1415-1416` skips null sessions and calls:\n3. `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session` (`sessions.py:337`) – the method that writes the cookie. It:\n   - adds `Vary: Cookie` if the session was accessed.\n   - calls `response.delete_cookie` if the session was modified to empty.\n   - otherwise checks `cookie_needs_write` (`sessions.py:234`), signs the data with `make_signer(app).dumps(...)`, and calls `response.set_cookie(...)` (`sessions.py:374`).\n\nThe cookie attributes come from the `get_cookie_*` helpers in `sessions.py:172-221`. `testing.py:177` also calls `persist_session` directly for the test client's session transaction.",
